{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Moldiver","Hiroshi Ozora invents the Mol Unit, a device that makes its user invincible. His plans of becoming a super hero are short lived however when his sister, Mirai, accidently modifies the suit configuration. Now she is forced to save Tokyo by herself from the evil Machinegal and his gang of all-female androids.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["モルダイバー",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-571","ids":{"shikimori":571,"mal":571,"anilist":571,"kodik":"serial-23371"},"kodikIds":["serial-23371"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-23371":"2020-03-04T17:25:58Z"},"title":"Молдайвер","originalTitle":"Moldiver","alt":"Молдайвер OVA モルダイバー","description":"Хироси Одзора изобретает устройство Mol, которое делает своего пользователя неуязвимым. Однако его планам стать супергероем не суждено сбыться, когда его сестра Мирай Одзора случайно изменяет конфигурацию костюма. Теперь она вынуждена в одиночку спасать Токио от злого Машинегала и его банды андроидов, состоящей исключительно из женщин.","year":1993,"type":"OVA","genres":["Романтика","Фантастика","меха"],"rating":6.26,"popularity":1896,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/571/62d7a0b849a44317b1c13204ab9e9fa4.jpeg","width":314,"height":450},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n571-IcEncehvqKrD.jpg","width":1093,"height":364}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-674","dubId":"674","label":"Люб. Одноголосый","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-23371","translationId":"674","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/602436/c9513dce466c555dc1e57771981b6f2b/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-674"